{"type":"text","timestamp":1770256628688,"sessionID":"ses_3d47cbba8ffeoTqtrGaXDBby6P","part":{"id":"prt_c2b8473d5002aoSHnASv4oN4Tq","sessionID":"ses_3d47cbba8ffeoTqtrGaXDBby6P","messageID":"msg_c2b8464b7001Mda6UvElXv6EkG","type":"text","text":"I've created the `ThemeInfo` server component and integrated it into your application.\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n1.  **Created `app/components/ThemeInfo.tsx`**:\n    *   This is an **async** server component that uses `next/headers`.\n    *   It reads the `theme` cookie, defaulting to `'light'`.\n    *   It reads the `Accept-Language` header.\n2.  **Updated `app/page.tsx`**:\n    *   Imported and rendered `<ThemeInfo />` to display the preferences on the home page.\n\n### `app/components/ThemeInfo.tsx`\n\n```tsx\nimport { cookies, headers } from 'next/headers';\n\nexport default async function ThemeInfo() {\n  const cookieStore = await cookies();\n  const theme = cookieStore.get('theme')?.value || 'light';\n\n  const headersList = await headers();\n  const acceptLanguage = headersList.get('accept-language') || 'Unknown';\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-4 border rounded shadow-sm\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">User Preferences</h2>\n      <div className=\"space-y-1\">\n        <p>\n          <span className=\"font-semibold\">Theme:</span> {theme}\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <span className=\"font-semibold\">Language:</span> {acceptLanguage}\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nThe application has been successfully built with these changes.","time":{"start":1770256628687,"end":1770256628687},"metadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}}
